  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/459fad44-da37-49a6-99e9-83085f49c48d\" alt=\"cflogobanner\"></p>\n<h3><strong>關於：</strong></h3>\n<p>Create: Food 是一款基於擴充《Minecraft》中食物內容的附加模組。</p>\n<p>這些模組並非強制安裝，但為必要條件。若未安裝，許多物品將無法製作。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>這些模組非必需，但強烈建議安裝。若未安裝，會發現內容明顯不足。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Creators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Display Delight</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>關於與 Create &amp; Farmer's Delight 附加模組的相容性資訊，請點此<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>查看。</p>\n<h3><strong>目前內容：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>超過 1000 種食物相關物品與超過 100 種新流體。查看物品列表請點此<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Item-list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</li>\n<li>所有設定高度可調，包含隱藏物品、修改營養值/飽食度數值，以及新增自訂物品、方塊、流體與展示盤。了解更多請點此<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Config-Options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</li>\n<li>完整實作來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flets-do.ch%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's Do 系列</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaleidoscope-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaleidoscope Cookery</a> 等模組的效果。</li>\n<li>針對簡單食譜的手動製作系統。了解更多請點此<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Handcrafting-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</li>\n<li>任何物品均可放置於展示盤上。您也可以直接從盤子上食用，或將其作為砧板使用。閱讀指南請點此<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Display-Blocks-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</li>\n<li>布過濾器可於手中或配方中使用。了解更多請點此<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Cloth-Filters-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</li>\n<li>兩種儲存方塊：布袋與配給箱。了解更多請點此<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Storage-Blocks-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</li>\n<li>可放置的披薩、蛋糕、派（含南瓜派）等方塊。</li>\n<li>熱飲的動態紋理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2.0.0 版本之前的相關資訊可點此<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>查看。</p>\n<h3><strong>物品預覽 (2.5.0)</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a20d646f-981a-4eaa-8755-852639e6cd96\" alt=\"fullprev250\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/993237fc-c7c8-4325-a47b-9e9401f5b213\" alt=\"bucketprev240\"></p>\n<h3><strong>我的其他模組</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-engineers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Engineers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-metalwork-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Metalwork</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-chefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Chefs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rune Essence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-size-edit-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stack Size Edit</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>致謝：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>紋理素材基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 中的資源。</li>\n</ul>",
